WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.062
Today we will use evidence to discuss a performance. Our work connects with Ghanaian

00:00:05.062 --> 00:00:06.451
and other African artists.

00:00:07.283 --> 00:00:09.822
Watch or listen carefully without interrupting.

00:00:11.283 --> 00:00:16.179
Record one strength in timing, expression or teamwork. Record why your chosen

00:00:16.179 --> 00:00:17.811
technique suits the message.

00:00:18.617 --> 00:00:21.859
Suggest one useful change and say how to rehearse it.
